            "review_title": "Review at Tamarind the rooftop",
            "review_text": "Ester C\n4 contributions\n0\nChill resto-bar in the heart of Nha Trang\nDec 2025 • Solo\nAbsolutely 💯!\nThey have Indian restaurant. The food is passable. And the staff are great. They are warm and speaks English.\nFooph is the man! I love his attitude.\nVisit this roof top bar if you happen to be in Nha Trang.\nThe prices are relatively cheaper than most of rooftop bar places here.\nRead more\nInsider tip:\nIndian cuisine. Cheap beers to start. Classic cocktails around 5-6usd Quiet surroundings. Majority tourist.\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten December 23, 2025",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-11",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
        },
